00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:03.180
Regarding the communication and planning,
in September the new PubMed will be formally

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:10.610
announced by NLM. That means that PubMed Labs
will have more words on it to say this is

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:16.589
